164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 136 0 R
/T (This report presents 18 advanced queries on the Airline Reservation System database, loaded with sample_data_insertion.sql \(20 passengers, 12 airports, 8 aircraft, 28 flights, 50 bookings\). The queries use joins to combine related tables and subqueries to answer questions that need a result inside another query. Together they produce reports an airline would actually use: passenger manifests, flight load, revenue, customer value, airport traffic and a management summary. Every query is followed by its output and a short explanation, and all of them are in the script advanced_queries.sql.)
/E (This report presents 18 advanced queries on the Airline Reservation System database, loaded with sample_data_insertion.sql \(20 passengers, 12 airports, 8 aircraft, 28 flights, 50 bookings\). The queries use joins to combine related tables and subqueries to answer questions that need a result inside another query. Together they produce reports an airline would actually use: passenger manifests, flight load, revenue, customer value, airport traffic and a management summary. Every query is followed by its output and a short explanation, and all of them are in the script advanced_queries.sql.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
